Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title" : "book1",
  "description": "저어어어엉말 유익한 책",
  "publisher": "pub1",
  "author": "Lee",
  "publishedDate": "2025-06-09",
  "isbn": "isbn001111117",
  "originalPrice": 1000,
  "salePrice": 500,
  "wrappable": false,
  "stock": 100
}

### 도서 추가
